  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4971c5eb32d68c6419c2b82ec69e3fa3, type: 3}
  m_Name: NPCStareOne
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarratorEventData
  eventID: NPCStareOne
  dialogueLines:
  - The player has been staring at this worker for quite a while. You good?
  - The player has been looking at this worker for an awfully long time. Everything
    alright?
  - "The player hasn\u2019t taken their eyes off this worker. Is there something
    they\u2019re waiting for?"
  - The player has been watching this worker for a while now. Perhaps they should
    look elsewhere.
  - The player has been watching the worker for quite some time. Surely they have
    something else to do.
  - "The player hasn\u2019t moved their gaze in a while. Perhaps it\u2019s time to
    look at something else."
  - The player has been staring at this poor worker for ages. Maybe give them some
    privacy?
  - The worker is trying to work. The player, meanwhile, appears to be studying them.
  - The player has spent a surprisingly long time staring at this worker. Everything
    okay?
  - The worker is busy doing their job. The player seems very interested in watching
    them do it.
  - "That\u2019s quite a long time to be staring at someone. Perhaps the player should
    move along."
  - "The player has been watching this worker for a while now. Maybe it\u2019s time
    to give them a break."
  canRepeat: 1
